 <iati-activity default-currency="USD" hierarchy="1" iati-activities:version="2.02" linked-data-uri="https://www.iadb.org/en/project/PE-L1003" xml:lang="EN" xmlns:iati-activities="http://d-portal.org/xmlns/iati-activities" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <iati-identifier>XI-IATI-IADB-PE-L1003</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Border Crossings</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Pasos de Frontera</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Principalmente, el objetivo del proyecto consiste en llevar a cabo acciones integrales en tres centros de frontera de Per, en particular en las fronteras con Bolivia, Chile y Brasil (Iapari), que contribuyan a la facilitacin del comercio binacional y regional. Complementariamente, el proyecto permitira facilitar la participacin del sector privado en acciones dirigidas a fortalecer el comercio binacional fronterizo a travs de la oferta de servicios de logstica y transporte de mayor valor agregado.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to support the development of comprehensive actions in three border crossing points in Peru, particularly in the borders with Bolivia, Chile and Brazil, aimed at facilitating regional and bi-national trade. Complementary, the program will encourage private sector involvement in the development of general and logistic added value services, thus contributing to reinforce competitiveness in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
